    "body": "We used an offline VM running a copy of our Agie Classic Cut 2S machine control. We imported CAMCraft’s five-sided punches and ran FORMALCHECK and GRAFICHECK. The plotted paths followed all five faces at the four expected outward offsets. The control preserved the threading point and the 1 mm separation on the oblique face.\n\nAll controller runs were offline. No physical cut was made.\n",
